WEBVTT

00:00:00.830 --> 00:00:05.360
So, as you can see, regular bathing and 
brushing will keep your feathers clean

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.350
and lead to a healthier lifestyle.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.790
Now, let's give it a try.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.310
Brush in the direction of your feathers,

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.780
and gently, gently...

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:20.570
Make sure you don't brush too 
hard and damage your feathers.

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:23.210
Doctor... You're so good.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.380
That feels so good, Doctor...

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:30.710
Let's see... Maybe I'll demonstrate 
this brushing on another—

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.590
Me! Pick me!

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:33.840
It's my turn!

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:34.600
No, me!

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:35.590
Me!

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:43.270
We'll finally be able to return to Lindworm.

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:44.220
Yeah.

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:47.100
I think I've done everything I could here.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:52.350
We've been away from the clinic for a while, 
and we should get back before it snows.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.690
Illy! Stop coming in through the w—

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.950
Doctor!

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:01.360
Ugh, what is this?!

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:04.930
I was flying through the forest 
and got this stuff all over me!

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:06.690
Ew, it's so gross!

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:08.950
It tastes so bitter in my mouth!

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:11.210
Is it all right if I touch it?

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:12.260
Uh-huh.

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.660
It's more like thread than liquid...

00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:22.840
It must be spider silk... 
no, silk from an arachne.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:25.290
What's that?

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:27.980
They're monsters whose 
lower halves resemble spiders.

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.690
I'm assuming the threads they use 
to get around were left in the forest.

00:01:31.990 --> 00:01:33.850
It'll wash off with warm water.

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:35.520
You should take a dip in the hot springs.

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:38.070
Really?! Okay, off I go!

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:41.700
Wanna join me in the hot springs, Doctor?

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.080
Ugh, just get going!

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:52.110
Wipe that stupid grin off your face, Doctor.

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:57.140
I'm not grinning! I'm just 
happy Illy's doing better.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:00.720
Uh-oh, now I've done it.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.680
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.680
Sapphee, could you get me some hot water?

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:14.200
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:36.940
Case 7        The Hedonistic Arachne

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:35.430
Doctor!

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:37.430
What is this?

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:37.430
What is this stuff?

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:37.430
This feels yucky.

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:40.830
Do something about this sticky white stuff!

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:42.780
It's so gross.

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:42.780
Uh, everyone, please calm down.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:42.400
Ugh.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.780
This is awful.

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:45.220
It'll wash off easily with warm water.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.190
It's just arachne silk.

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:48.210
It's so gross...

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.230
It's so sticky!

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:58.240
I guess we'll have to get to 
the root of this problem.

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:01.380
We'll have to track down this arachne

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:05.900
and ask them to stop leaving 
their webs everywhere.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.260
Thanks, Sapphee.

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:26.850
An arachne has clearly come through here.

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:28.420
If we follow that...

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.980
It should lead us to the one 
leaving behind all this silk.

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:36.920
Your clothes are also made 
by arachnes, aren't they?

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:41.560
Yes. Apparently, it's difficult to make clothes 
that block light if you're not an arachne.

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:44.550
Some of their silk sticks, and some doesn't.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:48.050
They're able to use strong, 
elegant silk however they want.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:51.380
Arachnes are truly talented.

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:54.280
Yes. Please be careful, Doctor.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:58.220
The things they're best at making are traps.

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:03.910
Don't worry. It's not like I'm going 
to walk into silk that's this visibl—

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.370
What did I just tell you?

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:10.900
Sorry...

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:15.610
They'll find out through the threads 
that something's caught in their trap.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:34.340
Oh, so it was you, Arahnia.

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:37.500
Well, well... If it isn't Sapphee.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:40.340
What're you doin' so deep in these mountains?

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:44.280
The doctor and I came here 
to help out the village.

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:50.550
I see. So this careless gentleman is the 
doctor you're always talkin' about.

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:54.090
A pleasure, Doctor.

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:59.850
I'm Saphentite's best friend, 
Arahnia Taranterra Arachnida.

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:01.370
I'm delighted to make your acquaintance.

00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:02.580
Best friend?

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:07.350
We got closer over the years as I 
continued to order clothes from her.

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:11.710
She's the lead designer at Loose 
Silk Sewing's Lindworm location.

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:13.630
Loose Silk Sewing?

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:16.570
Isn't that the company 
specializing in monster apparel

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:19.250
that has locations all over the continent?

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:20.220
Yes.

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:26.110
My nurse uniform and the clothes she's 
wearing were all designed by Arahnia.

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:29.410
I'm Glenn Litbeit. It's nice to meet you.

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:33.410
I've heard <i>all</i> about you from Sapphee.

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:36.230
So what brings you here, Miss Arahnia?

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.500
Excellent question!

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:42.830
I heard there was a harpy in these 
mountains that has phoenix feathers.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.450
That news sure got around fast.

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:47.620
Never underestimate the 
arachne information network.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:49.700
Ah, the phoenix...

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:55.670
The miraculous bird whose rainbow wings 
change color every time they flap them...

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:59.460
I must make that a part of my new design.

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:01.670
I have to see them for myself!

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:06.770
So here I am. I set up a few traps 
hopin' I'd run into them, but...

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:08.140
T-Traps?!

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:12.020
Well, how else am I supposed to catch them?

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:14.850
Did you think that harpy 
was out in the wild?

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:17.670
That harpy lives in the village.

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:22.660
Unbelievable! Why didn't 
anyone tell me sooner?

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:30.960
That's the legendary phoenix?

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.580
There you are, my sweet.

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:36.310
Wh-What?

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:38.550
Excuse me, miss.

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:40.070
Uh, who are you?

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:42.590
Let me have a peek at those wings of yours.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:43.740
Stay away from me!

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:45.650
Just show them to me!

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:46.260
No way!

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:51.220
I'm beggin' you. Just let me see the tips.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:52.320
No way!

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:08.130
No! Get away from me!

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:08.550
Hold it right there!

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:16.330
I made Arahnia promise me that she won't 
leave her webs all over the forest anymore.

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:18.460
We should see fewer casualties now.

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:22.270
Oh, really? Fewer casualties, you say?

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.860
Just look at me! <i>Look</i> at me!

00:08:24.860 --> 00:08:26.750
What are you going to do about this?!

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:28.490
My, what terrible luck.

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:32.270
Luck has nothing to do with this! 
What in the world was that thing?

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:34.070
She's my best friend.

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.320
Then you need better friends.

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:40.460
How can you let someone so 
dangerous run free like that?

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:44.570
Arahnia isn't a bad person.

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:49.210
Though she does lose sight of everything 
around her when she's excited...

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.950
But I take exception to you 
calling her dangerous.

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:55.060
That's not what I'm trying to say.

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:57.140
It's just... How do I put it?

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:02.340
My womanly instinct? Whatever it is, 
it tells me she can't be trusted!

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:07.290
She didn't seem to feel a single ounce 
of guilt for covering me in this guck.

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:08.100
Now, now.

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:11.060
Miss Arahnia just wants 
a look at Illy's wings

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:13.280
to get inspiration for her next design.

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:15.430
Are you certain?

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:19.080
No matter what Arahnia may try to pull,

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:22.350
there's no need to worry with someone 
as strong as you around, Miss Tisalia.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:23.810
If you'll excuse me.

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.050
Hey, Sapphee, wait!

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:31.150
She really must be tired.

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:33.540
I wonder if it's because 
of the cold up here.

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:34.240
Huh?

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:39.530
I know that lamias are cold-blooded 
and don't handle cold weather well,

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:41.300
but she didn't seem that tired,

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:44.080
and she's working as fast as ever.

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:47.220
She's working too hard.

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:49.790
All to impress her beloved doctor.

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:54.000
I didn't even notice...

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.620
You may be an excellent doctor,

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:58.440
but you can be a bit dense when 
it comes to those closest to you.

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:02.930
A break?

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:07.210
Yeah. Miss Kay and 
Miss Lorna wanted to invite you.

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:10.200
Why not go relax a while at the hot springs?

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:13.970
I mean, you've been working nonstop 
since we arrived in this village.

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:16.810
I want you to be able 
to relax, too, Sapphee.

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:19.460
Think of it as a present from me.

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:22.840
A present from you...

00:10:26.570 --> 00:10:29.750
In that case, I guess I'll 
take you up on the offer.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:05.800
Wipey, wipey. Wipey, wipey. Wipey, wipey.

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:05.440
Heave-ho, heave-ho...

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:08.640
Vroom!

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:19.710
Oh? Sapphee's not here?

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.950
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.440
So what brings you here today?

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:29.580
My head feels fuzzy, and my 
joints aren't working too well.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:31.800
Then let's take your temperature first.

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:33.060
Sure thing.

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:37.130
You don't seem to have a fever.

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:39.470
Oh, is that so?

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:41.180
Could you open your mouth?

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:48.520
Your throat seems all right, too.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:51.810
I'm not seeing any obvious symptoms,

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:54.530
but you may be coming down with a cold.

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:00.730
Is something wrong?

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:02.850
Oh, it's nothing.

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:07.370
I was just admirin' the fact that a human 
doctor truly is lookin' after us monsters.

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:10.240
Yes, I'm doing my best.

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:15.000
I was wonderin' about this doctor that 
Sapphee would always talk about...

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:19.750
Now I see. No wonder Sapphee 
has the hots for you.

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:26.400
Anyway, I guess I'll go enjoy some fresh air.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:28.820
You probably shouldn't stay 
out in the cold too long.

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:32.020
Well, standin' around 
isn't goin' to cure this.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:35.140
Oh, by the way, Doctor...

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:39.500
If you're worried, why not 
accompany me on my walk?

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:50.660
Miss Arahnia, how far are we going?

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:53.570
I can't say. As far as I feel like, I wager.

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:57.200
Why don't we head back now? 
You might make yourself feel worse.

00:12:59.370 --> 00:13:01.340
<i>I tagged along because 
I was worried about her,</i>

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.880
<i>but if she's this chipper, 
she should be fine.</i>

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:07.390
I'm terribly sorry, but I'm 
going to head back now.

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:10.210
Make sure you watch your step.

00:13:14.090 --> 00:13:17.760
I just told you to watch your step.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:19.920
When did you set this trap?

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:21.590
As soon as we got here.

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:26.260
I laid some threads to catch you 
as soon as you tried to go back.

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:29.540
Coming may have been smooth sailing, but you 
might run into a storm on the way back...

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:32.420
So when you said you weren't feeling well...

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:34.150
I lied.

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:39.730
Why don't we have a little fun, Doctor?

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:41.400
And what do you mean by that?

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:46.960
Dear me, Doctor. I couldn't possibly 
say such a thing out loud.

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:50.350
Um... I don't think we're that close...

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:51.880
You're right.

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:56.790
To be quite honest, I don't feel even 
an ounce of admiration for you.

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:57.860
Well, in that case...

00:13:57.860 --> 00:14:00.340
But Sapphee is my dear, best friend,

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:04.850
so I'm very curious about this 
doctor she has the hots for.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:11.770
I've always had a terrible habit of 
wanting what other people have...

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:14.500
Especially those I'm closest to.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:18.710
Oh, it's not like I want 
to steal you away, though.

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:23.240
I just want her to share so we can match.

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:27.370
Like, you know... matching lovers and such.

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:30.240
I'm a doctor, and Sapphee is my assistant.

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:31.920
We aren't dating...

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:37.270
Indeed. And Sapphee cares too 
much about you to make a move.

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:41.360
What do you think would happen if I were to...

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.350
ravish you here and now?

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:45.310
Sapphee would get mad, obviously.

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:46.470
She sure would.

00:14:46.470 --> 00:14:49.580
And even more so, she'd panic.

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:54.880
"Oh, dearie me! If my precious doctor is 
going to be stolen away by my best friend..."

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:59.110
She'd say as she threw herself at you.

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:03.440
And then Sapphee and I will 
be connected through you.

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:06.450
Then she'll never be able to escape me.

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:08.710
Th-That's insane...

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:11.350
Indeed. But you know, Doctor,

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:14.740
that insanity is what drives my creations.

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:19.050
It produces some of the best 
fashion this world has ever seen.

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:21.490
Now, Doctor...

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:23.230
Leave everything to me.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:31.290
Divine punishment!

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:43.510
Miss Tisalia... What are you doing here?

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:47.510
I followed you. That must've 
been a harrowing experience.

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:51.950
Well, well... If it isn't the Scythia heiress.

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:55.100
I could've sworn I set traps 
so you couldn't follow us.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:59.100
I cut all of them down with 
this sword that Kay lent me.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.590
I heard everything you said.

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:05.880
Trying to ravish the doctor for your own 
warped view of friendship and fashion...

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:10.030
I shall never allow such violence!

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:13.690
I must say, I hate such conflicts as these.

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:16.990
How about you stay out of this?

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:19.540
This has nothing to do with you, heiress.

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:21.170
It absolutely does!

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:26.970
After all, the Good Doctor is set to court 
me and take over the Scythia empire.

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:29.830
Oh, then you're just tryin' 
to do the same thing.

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:31.770
You and I? Alike?

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:33.330
What makes you say that?

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:35.930
I'm doing this for the sake 
of friendship and my work.

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:39.920
You want the doctor as the 
heir for your great business.

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:41.560
See? We <i>are</i> the same.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:43.300
W-We are not!

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:45.730
Yes, I do want someone to 
take on the Scythia name,

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:48.680
but I truly love the doctor!

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:50.070
Are you sure about that?

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:55.490
Are you sure you didn't imagine you were 
fond of him because just happened to

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:58.570
appear in front of you as the 
perfect candidate to be the heir?

00:16:58.840 --> 00:17:00.950
Th-That's not... true...

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:05.570
If your business had nothing to do with it, 
then why don't you just elope?

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:07.330
B-But that's...

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:11.650
But it's my responsibility 
as the heiress to Scythia...

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:14.000
I could never do that to Kay and Lorna...

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:16.130
Then we are the same.

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:22.210
W-We are not! Because you... 
Because you're... I...

00:17:22.210 --> 00:17:23.660
Miss Tisalia?

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:27.860
You're...

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:29.100
You're?

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:31.850
You're... so...

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:33.320
annoying!

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:44.000
That was so dangerous! 
What possessed you to do that?!

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:46.720
Shut up, shut up, shut up right now!

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:50.150
How dare you try to use your 
complicated logic on me?!

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:53.410
I don't understand how love works!

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:55.970
It's not like I've been in love before!

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:57.790
You shouldn't sound so proud of that.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:18:02.980
Regardless, Dr. Glenn is the 
one I have deemed worthy.

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:06.120
I will not allow you to tell 
me these feelings aren't real,

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:09.370
and I am not like you, 
who said you aren't in love.

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.110
I am absolutely not like you!

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:14.610
I really hate dealin' with the likes of you.

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:22.080
<i>I need to stop them before 
they hurt each other.</i>

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:26.190
<i>But what should I—</i>

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:32.330
You two...

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:34.470
I can't brea—

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:37.320
seem to be saying whatever 
you please regarding my doctor.

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:40.610
Both of you saying you love 
him or you don't love him...

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:41.970
I don't want to hear it!

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:45.580
You're both clueless, 
so allow me to fill you in!

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:47.590
Dr. Glenn...

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:52.600
has no time to waste on courtship or love!

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:56.350
<i>Lamias don't have tear ducts...</i>

00:18:56.350 --> 00:19:00.930
<i>But just because you can't cry 
doesn't mean you aren't suffering.</i>

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:06.420
<i>I'm sorry I didn't realize 
it sooner... Sapphee...</i>

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:11.620
Doctor? Dr. Glenn?!

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:13.030
Good Doctor!

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:19.370
I'm so sorry... Truly.

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:23.250
It's okay. I know you 
didn't do it on purpose.

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:26.250
Though I'm not sure there's any point 
in apologizing while you're drinking.

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:30.550
How could I possibly deal 
with this without drinking?

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:33.350
More importantly, about Miss Arahnia...

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:36.900
Did you know she was plotting something?

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:39.800
Well, she is my best friend.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:45.090
Considering her personality, I figured 
something like this would happen eventually.

00:19:45.090 --> 00:19:46.510
I see.

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:53.870
I love you, Doctor.

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:05.020
And yet, one rival appears after another.

00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:10.070
Actually, I don't care if Arahnia 
were to steal you away from me.

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:15.430
Because I know Arahnia's not serious.

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:20.310
Even if you two were to physically 
connect, your hearts never would.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:22.540
But...

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:24.790
That's not the case with Miss Tisalia.

00:20:25.150 --> 00:20:30.040
She's just a bit clumsy when it comes 
to love, but she's always so earnest.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.020
I'm scared.

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:35.800
I'm scared that someone will 
steal you away from me someday.

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:42.400
Doctor?

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:43.510
S-Sapphee!

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:45.030
Yes?

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:50.520
We have our clinic, and there are a lot 
of things I don't know about the future...

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:54.010
But... as for anyone I'd 
share a drink with like this...

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:57.010
Sapphee, you're the only one.

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:00.530
D-Don't...

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:02.900
Don't try to tease me like that!

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.930
Vroom!

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:08.690
Wait for me!

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:09.930
I wonder what's going on with them.

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:13.480
I-It's because you said something so cheesy!

00:21:22.660 --> 00:21:24.500
This tremor...

00:21:24.980 --> 00:21:28.360
may be due to the giant's rage.

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:34.880
Long, long ago, giants known as gigas 
destroyed everything in their path,

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:38.630
and the enraged gods sealed them 
away in the Vivre Mountains.

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:43.850
Even so, their strength is everlasting.

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:47.580
According to legend, 300 years ago,

00:21:47.580 --> 00:21:51.900
our people neglected to make a 
sacrificial offering to pay our respects,

00:21:51.900 --> 00:21:54.170
and a giant appeared and 
nearly destroyed our village.

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:58.050
According to the men I sent out 
on an earlier survey of the area,

00:21:58.050 --> 00:22:04.180
something far bigger than any man 
was heading toward this village.

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
Case 8       Attack on Gigas

00:23:35.580 --> 00:23:38.980
Case 8: "Attack on Gigas."
